  "code": {
    "language": "cpp",
    "text": "class MinStack {\npublic:\n    /** initialize your data structure here. */\n    stack<int> stk, f;\n    MinStack() {\n\n    }\n\n    void push(int x) {\n        stk.push(x);                                             // 入栈\n        if (f.empty() || f.top() >= x) f.push(x);\n    }\n\n    void pop() {\n        if (stk.top() <= f.top()) f.pop();\n        stk.pop();                                               // 出栈\n    }\n\n    int top() {\n        return stk.top();\n    }\n\n    int getMin() {\n        return f.top();\n    }\n};\n\n/**\n * Your MinStack object will be instantiated and called as such:\n * MinStack* obj = new MinStack();\n * obj->push(x);\n * obj->pop();\n * int param_3 = obj->top();\n * int param_4 = obj->getMin();\n */",
